# Mobile artboard size — LOCKED (matches dashboard)

**Do not change without explicit user instruction.**

## Single stage size (every page)

All artboard surfaces use the same column as `/attendee-dashboard`:

| Token | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Artboard | **1080×1920** (`MOBILE_ARTBOARD_REF`) |
| Width | `--mobile-app-track-w` (tab pages too — bottom dock overlays fixed) |
| Height | `track-w × 1920 / 1080` |

Never use per-page native PNG pixel sizes (853×1844, 926×1698, 720×1280, etc.) for **stage width/height**.

## Applies to

- `/attendee-dashboard` — `.experience-dashboard-artboard`
- `/` intro — `.intro-flash-artboard`
- Login, create-account, email-gate — `.auth-attendee-artboard`, `.email-gate-page__stage`
- Tab pages (giving, music, buy-seeds, prayer) — `.mobile-artboard-tab-shell__stage`
- Holding room / live — `.holding-room-page__stage`
- `.bottom-dock` — same `--mobile-app-track-w`, centered

## PNG / video inside the stage

- `.mobile-artboard-art-fit` fills the 1080×1920 stage
- Media uses `object-fit: contain`, `object-position: center top`
- Overlay hotspots stay **percentage-based on the stage**, not on raw PNG file dimensions

## Desktop

Centered mobile column with black side margins — intentional. Do not widen to `100vw` or remove the track cap.
